# SUPERSEDED: this file is a Cloudflare Pages convention. This project
# deploys via `wrangler deploy` (a plain Worker with static assets), which
# doesn't reliably honor _redirects the way Pages does, combined with the
# assets binding's own default html_handling this produced a real infinite
# redirect loop in production (/governance.html -> /governance -> ...).
# All clean-URL routing now lives explicitly in worker/index.ts's
# CLEAN_URL_MAP/REDIRECTS instead. Kept below for reference only, not
# read by the live deploy.
#
